  "locations": {
    "_comment": "LinkedIn needs a geoId (find via the guest endpoint; leave blank to let LinkedIn resolve the text). JobSpy-backed boards such as Indeed, Glassdoor, ZipRecruiter, and Google Jobs need a location + country (USA, Australia, Canada, GB...). HiringCafe currently uses its public US SEO route; locations.hiring_cafe is kept for compatibility. The map auto-fits to wherever the jobs are.",
