    "_comment": "Case-insensitive substrings matched against a job's location text. Used to post-filter boards that don't support geo-scoping at the API level: the curated direct-ATS sweep, and NEOGOV/GovernmentJobs.com (a nationwide board). Keep this in sync with your locations.* entries above. NOTE: this list is intentionally Bay-Area + remote only; add \"california\" here if you want California-wide results.",
